{"id": "EUVD-2026-15284", "enisaUuid": "8dcc56f9-44d3-3d28-bc1f-a37c742037ee", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\naccel/amdxdna: Fix NULL pointer dereference of mgmt_chann\n\nmgmt_chann may be set to NULL if the firmware returns an unexpected\nerror in aie2_send_mgmt_msg_wait(). This can later lead to a NULL\npointer dereference in aie2_hw_stop().\n\nFix this by introducing a dedicated helper to destroy mgmt_chann\nand by adding proper NULL checks before accessing it.", "datePublished": "2026-03-25T10:27:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T10:06:57", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6b3546e3a8c664fb8b97f587fd268dc6e413d79b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/032ca7a9059c4ba6c329e0f1b442dab54dd9c3e5", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6270ee26e1edd862ea17e3eba148ca8fb2c99dc9"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-23328"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "28b57eaf-acca-3871-a002-916cce3ef3dd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.14"}, {"id": "2a12d823-28b0-35d4-b9ea-07b6a976d34c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.0"}, {"id": "370933f8-c0e9-39e9-b9b3-27d3f4126f65", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "4de60411-b422-3d21-88b2-235aab0fef48", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b87f920b934426a24d54613f12ed67c03ae05024 <6b3546e3a8c664fb8b97f587fd268dc6e413d79b"}, {"id": "61649072-fc66-3957-89b8-ef75760f3c20", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "6974d83a-a687-337f-83fb-f0baea4896a3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b87f920b934426a24d54613f12ed67c03ae05024 <032ca7a9059c4ba6c329e0f1b442dab54dd9c3e5"}, {"id": "7fe14957-cade-32b0-bcee-9dfb37e20a88", "product": {"name": "